#: ../../../boards/nxplpc/seeedArchPro.rst:22
msgid ""
"Platform :ref:`platform_nxplpc`: The NXP LPC is a family of 32-bit "
"microcontroller integrated circuits by NXP Semiconductors. The LPC chips are "
"grouped into related series that are based around the same 32-bit ARM "
"processor core, such as the Cortex-M4F, Cortex-M3, Cortex-M0+, or Cortex-M0. "
"Internally, each microcontroller consists of the processor core, static RAM "
"memory, flash memory, debugging interface, and various peripherals."
msgstr ""

